  "guidance": "Add or subtract time from a date.\n\n## Migrated examples\n#### Calculating a Future Date\n\n##### Recipe\n\n```yaml\nwrangles:\n   - date_calculator:\n      input: Date\n      output: New Date\n      operation: subtract  # Optional default is addition\n      time_unit: days\n      time_value: 1\n```\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-grid\">\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Input Sample\n\n| Date |\n| --- |\n| 2022-12-26 |\n\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Output Sample\n\n| New Date |\n| --- |\n| 2022-12-25 |\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
